# Proxy ArcGIS Online through our own domain so ad/tracker blockers and
# privacy browsers (which block requests to arcgis.com) don't hide the maps.
# These must come before the SPA catch-all below. The tile path is handled by
# an edge function (netlify/edge-functions/arcgis-tiles.js) that also rewrites
# the mislabeled content type; only the portal (item JSON) is a plain proxy.
/arcgis-portal/*   https://www.arcgis.com/:splat      200

